        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"I'm the future, tryna ball like a hooper, uh",
          "rhyme":"u",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"Attack a beat like a cougar, Ruger (Yup)",
          "rhyme":"e",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"Who the dude that wanna come and talk shit? (I don't know)",
          "rhyme":"it",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"5",
          "text":"I'm so fly, high up in my cockpit (Zoom)",
          "rhyme":"it",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"6",
          "text":"The tape's comin', boy, wait until I drop it (Drop it)",
          "rhyme":"it",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"7",
          "text":"It's some hot shit, I know y'all gon' cop it (Cop it)",
          "rhyme":"it",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"8",
          "text":"It's like Tha Carter III mixed with The Chronic (Classic)",
          "rhyme":"ik",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"9",
          "text":"Plus some Big L and Nas hits (Magic)",
          "rhyme":"it",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"10",
          "text":"I tell 'em, \"Watch this\" (Watch this), start spittin' out rockets",
          "rhyme":"Et",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"11",
          "text":"Light a beat up like your fiber optics",
          "rhyme":"ik",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"12",
          "text":"Pause (Pause, pause), you ain't seen this yet, kid (Uh-uh)",
          "rhyme":"id",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"13",
          "text":"Resurrectin' this DMX diff",
          "rhyme":"if",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"14",
          "text":"On tracks, I be doin' mad BMX flips (Chyeah)",
          "rhyme":"ip",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"15",
          "text":"Sex chicks and move on up to the next bitch (What's up, baby?)",
          "rhyme":"itS",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"16",
          "text":"Big like Texas, don't mess with the freshest (Nope)",
          "rhyme":"Est",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"17",
          "text":"Yeah, I spit electric, my set is the best (Uh-huh)",
          "rhyme":"Est",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"18",
          "text":"In the PA, country, continent, the world (World)",
          "rhyme":"Old",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"19",
          "text":"Cryin' lil' bitches, I ain't startin' with you girls",
          "rhyme":"9Rl",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"20",
          "text":"It's Mac (It's Mac), it's Mac, jump back (Uh-huh)",
          "rhyme":"ak",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"21",
          "text":"Dumb raps and my lungs is black, uh (Chyeah)",
          "rhyme":"u",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"22",
          "text":"Yeah, it's Mac, say it again, yeah",
          "rhyme":"E",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"23",
          "text":"Chest collapse when you takin' it in",
          "rhyme":"in",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"24",
          "text":"I'm playin' to win, spittin' it right (Right)",
          "rhyme":"ajt",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"25",
          "text":"We just a couple of kids livin' the life (Life)",
          "rhyme":"ajf",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"26",
          "text":"I'm stayin' sharp like the end of a knife",
          "rhyme":"ajf",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"27",
          "text":"And your girl come to me 'cause you ain't hittin' it right (Haha)",
