        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"And I don't rap for the stacks, I rap 'cause I rap (Rap)",
          "rhyme":"ap",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"And Mac be the cat with the haze and the dro (Uh-huh)",
