          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"9",
          "text":"And you ain't tight, you just alright (Uh-huh)",
          "rhyme":"ajt",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"10",
          "text":"I'm as nice as a calm night",
          "rhyme":"ajt",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"11",
          "text":"Chillin' with some broads, 'bout as raw as a bar fight (Get it, get it)",
          "rhyme":"ajt",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"12",
          "text":"Can't ignore me anymore, the bass bumpin' through the floor (Floor)",
          "rhyme":"OR",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"13",
          "text":"Make veterans feel like they ain't did it before",
          "rhyme":"OR",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"14",
          "text":"I'm a black belt, bitch, get ya ass kicked (Ass kicked)",
          "rhyme":"e",
